@startuml SEQ1 — Login & Browse
title SmartStays — Sequence Diagram (Part 1: Login & Browse Rooms)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4A6FA5

actor User
participant "React App" as React
participant "Spring Boot API\n:4040" as API
database "MySQL DB" as DB

== Authentication ==

User -> React : Navigate to /login
User -> React : Enter email + password
React -> API : POST /auth/login\n{email, password}
API -> DB : SELECT user WHERE email = ?
DB --> API : User record (hashed password, role)
API -> API : BCrypt.matches(input, hash)

alt Invalid credentials
  API --> React : 400 — invalid credentials
  React --> User : Show error message
else Valid credentials
  API -> API : JWTUtils.generateToken(user)
  API --> React : 200 OK {token, role, expirationTime}
  React -> React : localStorage.setItem("token", jwt)
  React --> User : Redirect to /home or /admin
end

== Browse All Rooms ==

User -> React : Navigate to /rooms
React -> API : GET /rooms/all
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM rooms
DB --> API : Rooms list (with roomPhotoUrl)
API --> React : 200 OK [Room[]]
note right of React
  roomPhotoUrl is an external Pexels URL
  (https://images.pexels.com/...).
  Images are loaded directly by the
  browser — no local file serving needed.
end note
React --> User : Render RoomCard list with images

@enduml
